{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a solution (root) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa25b6df24ca81eb497840763a2ed924bcba9ab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+hx+10=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"134\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/beacfebed9c4c0f40628759b36b5568f35ddf871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }10\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }9 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }-2\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }-9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"406\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. We are given that this equation is true. Thus, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/4821d841c42142b17891a652f9461b43b8a3b0be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3+2h+10 =0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd967d91fd93818f05e0298af01ca0ad45370821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18+2h=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e40fe049927c40828f8ef4e4acfa6e2fb4704094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2h=-18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/90686f4c4d530101fde788b94f6bf4ed89581ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h=-9$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/f/3af76c760c586bdfd6993730c4ec066de52718a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }-9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"78\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"no